                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "2.5/10\n\nNope.\n\nThis game is literally 1 map, with the same character model but different colors, spawning and you click around and it kills them. You keep clicking around until too many spawn and you are juggle spammed and can't do anything, which is what happened to me, and die. you will get a score. That's the entire game folks, you can repeat it, but I'd seen all I needed to see in 5 min. There are no abilities, or anything to add depth or anything. Free flash games online offer more than this, and do it with better graphics. Don't know why anyone would buy this game on purpose, as I got it in a bundle, and am still disappointed it's in my library.",
